    "description": "<blockquote><p><em><strong>Requirements:</strong> you must have mastered the <strong>Ritualist </strong>Class.</em></p></blockquote><p>Whenever you <strong>Rest</strong>, you may create a <strong>Mana Link</strong> between yourself and a willing ally. All previous <strong>Mana Links</strong> are lost when you create a new one. The <strong>Mana Link</strong> is also lost if either part of the link dies.</p><p>While the <strong>Mana Link</strong> remains active, both of you gain the following benefits as long as you are able to see or hear each-other:</p><ul><li><p>When you <strong>Cast a Spell</strong>, you may choose one from that ally’s list of spells.</p></li><li><p>When you <strong>recover MP</strong>, you may instead recover half as much <strong>MP</strong> and have that ally recover the other half.</p></li><li><p>When that ally <strong>spends or loses MP</strong>, you may pay up to <strong>half</strong> of that cost.</p></li></ul><p>If one of you uses any of the benefits from <strong>Mana Link</strong>, the other may use it until the current action or effect is fully resolved.</p>",
